---
// Generated by packages/calibration-lab/lab/figures.py from results.json. Do not edit by hand.
interface Props { caption?: boolean }
const { caption = true } = Astro.props;
---

<figure>
  <svg class="fig" viewBox="0 0 660 380" role="img" aria-label="Test ECE after recalibration against number of labels, for four maps.">
    <line x1="88.73" y1="30" x2="88.73" y2="332" class="grid" />
    <text x="88.73" y="352" class="tick mid">25</text>
    <line x1="159.34" y1="30" x2="159.34" y2="332" class="grid" />
    <text x="159.34" y="352" class="tick mid">50</text>
    <line x1="229.94" y1="30" x2="229.94" y2="332" class="grid" />
    <text x="229.94" y="352" class="tick mid">100</text>
    <line x1="300.55" y1="30" x2="300.55" y2="332" class="grid" />
    <text x="300.55" y="352" class="tick mid">200</text>
    <line x1="371.15" y1="30" x2="371.15" y2="332" class="grid" />
    <text x="371.15" y="352" class="tick mid">400</text>
    <line x1="441.76" y1="30" x2="441.76" y2="332" class="grid" />
    <text x="441.76" y="352" class="tick mid">800</text>
    <line x1="512.36" y1="30" x2="512.36" y2="332" class="grid" />
    <text x="512.36" y="352" class="tick mid">1600</text>
    <line x1="66" y1="332.0" x2="530" y2="332.0" class="grid" />
    <text x="56" y="336.0" class="tick end">0.00</text>
    <line x1="66" y1="231.33" x2="530" y2="231.33" class="grid" />
    <text x="56" y="235.33" class="tick end">0.05</text>
    <line x1="66" y1="130.67" x2="530" y2="130.67" class="grid" />
    <text x="56" y="134.67" class="tick end">0.10</text>
    <line x1="66" y1="30.0" x2="530" y2="30.0" class="grid" />
    <text x="56" y="34.0" class="tick end">0.15</text>
    <line x1="66" y1="332" x2="530" y2="332" class="axis" />
    <line x1="66" y1="30" x2="66" y2="332" class="axis" />
    <text x="298.0" y="372" class="label mid">labels used to fit the map</text>
    <text x="14" y="181.0" class="label mid" transform="rotate(-90 14 181.0)">test ECE after repair</text>
    <path class="ref" d="M66.0 127.36 L530.0 127.36" />
    <text x="525.84" y="121.36" class="note" text-anchor="end">unrepaired</text>
    <path class="series" d="M88.73 201.47 L159.34 229.26 L229.94 252.44 L300.55 266.69 L371.15 267.81 L441.76 271.01 L507.27 275.18" stroke="var(--viz-blue)" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.9" />
    <line x1="542" y1="38" x2="556" y2="38" stroke="var(--viz-blue)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <text x="542" y="56" class="key">temperature</text>
    <text x="542" y="70" class="note">1 number</text>
    <path class="series" d="M88.73 149.71 L159.34 186.44 L229.94 233.39 L300.55 262.18 L371.15 269.57 L441.76 288.76 L507.27 297.27" stroke="var(--viz-amber)" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.9" />
    <line x1="542" y1="80" x2="556" y2="80" stroke="var(--viz-amber)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <text x="542" y="98" class="key">platt</text>
    <text x="542" y="112" class="note">2 numbers</text>
    <path class="series" d="M88.73 132.46 L159.34 165.06 L229.94 175.08 L300.55 242.67 L371.15 265.45 L441.76 292.42 L507.27 291.55" stroke="var(--viz-rose)" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.9" />
    <line x1="542" y1="122" x2="556" y2="122" stroke="var(--viz-rose)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <text x="542" y="140" class="key">isotonic</text>
    <text x="542" y="154" class="note">a step function</text>
    <path class="series" d="M88.73 159.86 L159.34 165.71 L229.94 194.45 L300.55 240.16 L371.15 260.05 L441.76 291.69 L507.27 278.76" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.9" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
    <line x1="542" y1="164" x2="556" y2="164" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
    <text x="542" y="182" class="key">venn-abers</text>
    <text x="542" y="196" class="note">isotonic, twice</text>
  </svg>
  {caption && <figcaption>The probe, bent on purpose (cooled to T = 0.5, shifted +0.4 in log-odds), repaired with a growing pile of labels. Fewer parameters win early; the flexible maps need hundreds of labels before they stop fitting noise. Temperature stalls because it can&#x27;t undo the shift.</figcaption>}
</figure>

<style>
  .fig { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; margin: 1.6rem auto 0.6rem; }
  .fig text { font-family: var(--font-jetbrains); fill: var(--text-dim); }
  .fig .tick { font-size: 12px; }
  .fig .label { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fig .mid { text-anchor: middle; }
  .fig .end { text-anchor: end; }
  .fig .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .fig .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .fig .ref { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; fill: none; }
  .fig .series { fill: none; stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .fig .key { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .fig .note { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fig .big { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text); }
  figcaption {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0 auto 2.2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
